The pictures in this repository

Every picture here was generated by Kuutti ry with Google's Gemini API; PROVENANCE.md names, for each file, the model, the prompt and the date. They are held under the Gemini API terms of service as those stood on that date. Nobody in them is a real person.

They are public as test data of Kuutti (github.com/kuutti-ry/kuutti-app), for its demo and its tests. Kuutti ry grants no licence beyond that: never use them as anybody's profile, on any service, nor in marketing or a store listing.
